使用本仓库中的任何内容对您的硬件造成的一切后果(包括但不限于过热、硬件损坏、
数据丢失、无法开机等), 作者不承担任何责任。风险自负, 仅供学习研究。

The tools in this repository directly read/write laptop Embedded Controller
registers and are the product of unofficial reverse engineering. The author
takes NO responsibility for any consequences (overheating, hardware damage,
data loss, failure to boot, etc.) caused by using anything from this
repository. USE AT YOUR OWN RISK, for educational purposes only.
